 to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In Kagha's chest in the <a href=\"/wiki/Servant%27s_Quarters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Servant's Quarters\">Servant's Quarters</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-488&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-8</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading this note advances <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_Kagha\" title=\"Investigate Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Investigate Kagha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_Kagha\" title=\"Investigate Kagha\">Investigate Kagha</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The marks crisscrossing the page don't look scribed so much as slashed.]<br>\n</p><p><br>\nKagha.\n</p><p><br>\nSwamp-docks. Tree. Meet me. Alone.\n</p><p><br>\nOlodan.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202729\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2293/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31652/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8158/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUns